# Docs and repo content — English by default

When editing **any** file in this repository (Markdown, comments in code, Ansible descriptions, Terraform notes, Cursor rules text that is documentation), write and update content in **English**.

- If you open or change a French file, **translate the touched sections to English** in the same edit (prefer whole-file translation for small docs).
- Do not leave new French prose in files you modify.
- Chat with the user for lab procedures may stay in **French** ([lab-workflow](lab-workflow.mdc)); only the **repository artifacts** must be English.

Exceptions: do not rewrite unchanged French files “for free” unless the user asks for a full migration or you already need to edit them.
